{
  "type": "Game.Scripts.Notes.NoteDef",
  "Title": "",
  "Text": "...Marta's been strange today. She says she hears voices in her head. Maybe she's just tired – none of us have slept in a long time.\r\nIn the evening, she was sitting at the table, eating something. At first I didn't realize what it was. Then I noticed her whole hand was covered in blood. She smiled at me and said it tasted better than the canned food.",
  "ButtonText": "OK?",
  "Id": "Note02"
}